# Throne of the Grim Captain's materials are asked one at a time, and each question offers only what still leaves every
# later one a separate object (CR 702.167a, the card's ruling). Bot1's Merfolk are Hullbreacher (a Merfolk Pirate) and
# Thieving Skydiver; its only Pirate is the Hullbreacher. So as the Merfolk, Hullbreacher is not offered (refused) - taking
# it would leave no Pirate - and the Skydiver is; then the Hullbreacher is the Pirate.

